    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a giant leap as you pilot the iconic lunar module to a precision landing on a miniature moon landscape in this modern reimagining of a classic moon lander game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully manage fuel and use precise inputs to touch down on designated landing spots, or explore the moon\u2019s surface freely. Whether you aim for efficient landings or simply enjoy the challenge of flight, this game offers a mix of skill-based gameplay and exploration.</p>",
